# A re-check for a waiting patient, ended early from the sitting screen.
# The app is started again first: in the simulator the sitting screen often does not open a
# second time in one run of the app, and now and then not after a restart either (BUG-14 in
# docs/OVERNIGHT_BACKLOG.md). If this flow fails on "Start sitting", that is what happened.
run open-app.flow
wait "Re-check" 120
sleep 3
tap "~Maya Chen"
wait "Start sitting" 60
tap "Start sitting"
wait "End sitting now"
sleep 12
shot recheck-running
tap "End sitting now"
wait "End the sitting now?"
shot recheck-end-early
tap "End sitting"
wait "Sitting summary" 60
wait "Re-check saved" 60
shot recheck-summary
tap "Next patient"
wait "Re-check"
